**Verdict:** Pro is the best pick for most people — it clears the three things that actually block growth (multiple seats, real storage, API access) at less than half the Team price. Choose Team only if you need SSO, audit logs or a dedicated contact; if it's just you testing the waters, Basic is the cheapest way in — but the jump to Pro is where the product becomes usable for a team.

